  "internal": "Author list is deliberately partial. The paper has 135 named authors; recorded here are the first ten plus every Astropy Active Voting Member who is on it (26 more, from config/astropy-voting-members.json, read 2026-08-25) - the people who run the project rather than the wider list who signed it. ORCIDs are recorded only where that ORCID record itself claims this DOI, which is 19 of the 36; the rest are named without one and so do not reach the collaborator map. Two surname collisions were rejected on first initial: Daria Cara is not Mihai Cara, and Rohit R. Patil is not Aarya Patil.",
